<title>USA: Sioux City feeder cattle light, firm tone - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City feeder cattle light, firm tone - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Supply: 400. Trade was moderately active, with no recent price comparisons available for Sioux City, however firm undertone noted, USDA said.</p>
<p>Availability of grass and lower grain prices have increased demand for feeder cattle.  Supply consisted of 75 percent feeders over 600 lbs.</p>
